{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":496363,"name":"Zomer Yevgeny","username":"Zomer_Yevgeny","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/z/7c8e57/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-20T12:55:22.502Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-496363-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-496363-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-496363-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-496363-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003egrok stuck at 43% updating for an hour\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-496363-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-496363-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eone of my bots stopped responding.\u003cbr\u003e\ni clicked on reset, and from that point i cant work anymore\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-496363-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-496363-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eno bot responds. nothing happens. all is stuck\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-496363-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-496363-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/1/a1082684ba565781b15e1af86ab3a05099c42721.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/mYykLQBQke4VlpDNwHiOcxwqgEx.png?dl=1\" title=\"Screenshot_334.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.disc